flowchart TB
    A[SELECT query] --> B[EXPLAIN before index]
    B --> C[Read plan]
    C --> D[Create index]
    D --> E[EXPLAIN after index]
    E --> F[Compare plan]

    F --> G[Seq Scan]
    F --> H[Index Scan]
    F --> I[Bitmap Index Scan]

    G --> J[Interpret result]
    H --> J
    I --> J
